---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<section class="intro">
  <h1 class="intro-name">Lakshmikant Deshpande</h1>
  <p class="intro-role">Senior Software Engineer at PayPal</p>
  <p class="intro-bio">I&rsquo;m a software engineer at PayPal, where I lead a small team building payment systems that move money across open banking rails. I care about dependable, well-tested backend code. I also make small apps and experiment with practical AI. I share what I make on Programmer Cat, my other personal website.</p>
  <ul class="intro-links">
    <li>
      <a href="{{ site.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        {% include "icons/github.svg" %} <span>GitHub</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        {% include "icons/linkedin.svg" %} <span>LinkedIn</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">
        {% include "icons/mail.svg" %} <span>Email</span>
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p class="intro-more"><a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about me <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
</section>

<section class="section" id="experience">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Experience</h2>
  </div>
  <ol class="timeline">
    <li class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-logo" title="PayPal">
        {% include "icons/paypal.svg" %}
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-content">
        <div class="timeline-head">
          <div class="timeline-title">
            <h3 class="timeline-role">Senior Software Engineer</h3>
            <span class="timeline-company">PayPal</span>
            <span class="timeline-note">Software Engineer 3 from Aug 2021 to Apr 2025</span>
          </div>
          <span class="timeline-dates">Apr 2025 &ndash; Present</span>
        </div>
        <p class="timeline-desc">Leading a five-developer team building a multi-tenant UK payment initiation system on Faster Payments rails, from design through integrations, settlement, and reconciliation. Other work there includes an aggregator switching service, a payment eligibility API, and settlement pipelines.</p>
        <a class="text-link timeline-link" href="/experience/paypal/">What I worked on at PayPal <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-logo" title="AppZen">
        {% include "icons/appzen.svg" %}
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-content">
        <div class="timeline-head">
          <div class="timeline-title">
            <h3 class="timeline-role">Senior Backend Engineer</h3>
            <span class="timeline-company">AppZen</span>
          </div>
          <span class="timeline-dates">Feb 2020 &ndash; Aug 2021</span>
        </div>
        <p class="timeline-desc">Re-architected a customer-specific export service into a configurable platform that onboarded new customers without code changes.</p>
        <a class="text-link timeline-link" href="/experience/appzen/">What I worked on at AppZen <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-logo" title="Clairvoyant">
        {% include "icons/clairvoyant.svg" %}
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-content">
        <div class="timeline-head">
          <div class="timeline-title">
            <h3 class="timeline-role">Software Engineer 2</h3>
            <span class="timeline-company">Clairvoyant</span>
          </div>
          <span class="timeline-dates">Mar 2017 &ndash; Feb 2020</span>
        </div>
        <p class="timeline-desc">Built a reusable email, SMS, and web notification service from scratch, including its database schema and a reusable Angular component.</p>
        <a class="text-link timeline-link" href="/experience/clairvoyant/">What I worked on at Clairvoyant <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="timeline-item">
      <div class="timeline-logo" title="Persistent Systems">
        {% include "icons/persistent.svg" %}
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-content">
        <div class="timeline-head">
          <div class="timeline-title">
            <h3 class="timeline-role">Software Engineer</h3>
            <span class="timeline-company">Persistent Systems</span>
          </div>
          <span class="timeline-dates">Sep 2015 &ndash; Mar 2017</span>
        </div>
        <p class="timeline-desc">Built a cancer-patient health survey Android app from scratch with the client, including push notifications, data persistence, and tests.</p>
        <a class="text-link timeline-link" href="/experience/persistent/">What I worked on at Persistent Systems <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="personal" id="programmer-cat">
  <div class="personal-inner">
    <div class="personal-mark" aria-hidden="true">
      {% include "icons/programmercat.svg" %}
    </div>
    <div class="personal-copy">
      <h2>Programmer Cat</h2>
      <p>My other personal website. I make small apps and tools out of interest, often when something annoys me. I share them there.</p>
      <p class="personal-links">
        <a class="text-link" href="https://programmercat.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit programmercat.com <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Posts</h2>
    <a class="text-link" href="/posts/">All posts &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  <div class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
        {% include 'post-row.njk' %}
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <div class="posts-empty">
        <p>I haven&rsquo;t written any posts yet. When I do, they will be listed here.</p>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
